Package: punto-switcher
Version: @PUNTO_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @PUNTO_ARCHITECTURE@
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.20.6)
Depends: @PUNTO_DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Anton Shalin <anton.shalin@gmail.com>
Description: automatic and manual EN/RU keyboard corrections for X11
 Punto Switcher processes keyboard input through interception-tools and corrects
 layout, case and spelling with guarded X11 operations. It supports selection
 transformations, immediate undo, learned exclusions and optional layout sounds.
 The package includes a command-line control client. The default artifact includes
 a GTK system-tray client; the explicit daemon-only flavor does not.
